            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It can be concluded from the research reported above that diclofenac diethylammonium (NSAID) in cases of professional swimmers and waterpolo players who have either an ache or suffered a severe hit, when applied externally offers rapid and excellent results.</AbstractText>
